    "heading": "Level II: Relentless Rage",
    "lineStart": 2361,
    "lineEnd": 2365
  },
  "section": "3.20",
  "rulesText": "Your Rage can keep you fighting despite grievous wounds. If you drop to 0 Hit Points while your Rage is active and don't die outright, you can make a DC 10 Constitution saving throw. If you succeed, your Hit Points instead change to a number equal to twice your Barbarian level.\n\nEach time you use this feature after the first, the DC increases by 5. When you finish a Short or Long Rest, the DC resets to 10."
}
